flowchart TB
  caller[host setup or explicit CLI] --> read[read original config / reject forbidden symlink]
  read --> propose[host-specific owned fields and hooks]
  propose --> unchanged{changed?}
  unchanged -->|no| noop[exit 0 / preserve bytes]
  unchanged -->|yes| mode{apply?}
  mode -->|no| diff[print diff / keep real config]
  mode -->|yes| archive[backup original text / owner-only archive]
  archive --> kind{host writer}
  kind -->|Codex| prepare[prepare changed file set]
  prepare --> replace[replace in order]
  replace -->|complete| success[print applied / return to caller]
  replace -->|failure| rollback[reverse replaced files]
  rollback --> failure[raise original and any rollback failure]
  kind -->|Claude / Cursor| single[temp write + fsync + mode + replace]
  single --> success
  single -->|failure| restore[restore changed original if possible / remove temp]
  restore --> failure
  kind -->|Grok| cfg[config apply first if changed]
  cfg --> hooks[generate real hook file / unlink old destination / replace]
  hooks --> success
  hooks -->|failure| partial[config may remain changed / old hook may be absent]
  partial --> failure
  failure --> archivekept[backup retained for recovery]
  propose -.-> parser[Codex dry-run also uses CLI parser in temporary HOME]
  success -.-> session[new host session and UI adoption are separate]
